  tag="On its own, or as part of Stage 1 and Stage 2"
  sections={[
    {
      id: "rs-what",
      heading: "What it is",
      lede: "Permission to be a kid again.",
      paras: [
        "To laugh, to try things that scare you a little, to do something you've always wanted to do but never had the time or permission for.",
        "Day 1 is all about play and adventure. Day 2 is about meaning: writing, building, connecting. This isn't meant to be deep work. It's the opposite. It's lightness.",
      ],
      boxes: [
        {
          title: "What it is",
          tone: "grass",
          items: [
            "1.5 days in person with your Wayfinder, where you are",
