      paras: ["You design the Residency with your Wayfinder, choosing from four categories."],
      steps: [
        {
          label: "Day 1",
          title: "Adventure",
          text: "Physical, exhilarating, something that makes your heart race. A hot air balloon at sunrise, paragliding, surfing, rock climbing. Pick the one that scares you a little.",
        },
        {
          label: "Day 1",
          title: "Creative play",
          text: "Artistic and hands-on: pottery, painting, cooking, music, dance. If you were ten years old with a free Saturday, what would you want to do?",
        },
        {
          label: "Day 1 evening",
          title: "Novel experience (optional)",
          text: "A concert, a comedy show, the theatre, a food tour, a sunset somewhere you've never been. Or a quiet dinner.",
        },
        {
          label: "Day 2 morning",
          title: "Meaningful work",
          text: "Something that connects you to purpose: a letter to your kids, a call to someone you haven't spoken to in years, your personal manifesto.",
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      id: "rs-after",
      heading: "Before and after",
      boxes: [
        {
          title: "Before",
          tone: "grass",
          items: [
            "You choose your activities with your Wayfinder",
            "You get your itinerary with times, places and what to expect",
            "Bring comfortable clothes, an open mind and a willingness to play",
          ],
        },
        {
          title: "After: the debrief",
          tone: "sky",
          items: [
            "What shifted, in your body, your energy and your outlook",
            "What you can see now that you couldn't before",
            "One small commitment for the next seven days that keeps it alive",
          ],
        },
      ],
      note: "If you're nervous, that's perfect. Nervous means you're doing something worth doing.",
    },
  ]}
  closing={{
